From: Dynamic Devices <engineering@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: remove unused compare include

crypto_random.cc does not use declarations from <compare>. Removing the
unused include lets Node's native tools build with Clang against the older
host libstdc++ supplied by the Foundries worker, which has no <compare>
header.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Foundries host libstdc++ compatibility]

diff --git a/src/crypto/crypto_random.cc b/src/crypto/crypto_random.cc
index f5e2ab1..c1ec173 100644
--- a/src/crypto/crypto_random.cc
+++ b/src/crypto/crypto_random.cc
@@ -12 +11,0 @@
-#include <compare>
